{"articleNo":"58613","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=58613&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.07.09","hit":"8518","attachments":[{"name":"붙임1. 2012학년도 2학기 농어촌융자 학생신청 매뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=58613&attachNo=1286"},{"name":"붙임2_농어촌융자 신청안내 팝업 이미지.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=58613&attachNo=1287"},{"name":"붙임3. 2012학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생학자금융자 세부시행계획(학생).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=58613&attachNo=1288"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000cc; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2012학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 신청대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"> </span></font></strong></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 농어촌지역에 주소를 두고 6개월(거주기간 180일) 이상 거주하고 있는 학부모의 자녀</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;또는 학생본인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학생(복학생, 편입생, 재입학생 포함) - 대학원생제외</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">. 성적기준&nbsp; </span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학생 : 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상, 12학점이상 이수자-계절학기성적제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 졸업학기 학생과 장애우 학생은 12학점미만 이수자도 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">*</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">3. 신청 및 서류제출 기간 :</font></strong> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 7. 11(수) ~ 7. 20(금) 18:00까지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> (기한엄수)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;* 기한내에만 서류제출가능(신청 후 신청서 및 증빙서류를 반드시 대학으로 제출 해야함)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">*</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>4. 서류제출장소 </strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>:</strong> 금오공대 학생처(본관 101호)</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 등기접수가능 : 우) 730-701 경북 구미시 대학로 61 금오공과대학교 학생처(본관 101호)</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* 반드시 등기접수 : 일반우편시 분실우려있음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">5. 지원금액</font></strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"> :</font></strong> 등록금 범위 내 신청액 전액 무이자 융자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">6. 신청방법 : [붙임1]</font></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금지원통합시스템(</span><a href=\"http://scholar.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">http://www.kosaf.go.kr</font></u></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) 접속 → 회원가입 또는 로그인→&nbsp;학자금대출안내 → 농어촌출신대학생학자금 → 신청하기 클릭 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금융자 신청양식의 기재사항을 입력 후 증빙서류 확인 후 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청학생은 로그인 후 신청하여야 하며, 약정서 동의 시 공인인증서로 재확인함에</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;따라 반드시 학생은 공인인증서 필요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">7. 제출서류 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span></strong></font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">기본 및 추가 제출서류 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"31\" valign=\"center\" width=\"60\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"31\" valign=\"center\" width=\"236\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">제 출 서 류</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4